Beast 3.0 Labor & Workforce Development Division
The Labor & Workforce Development Division serves as the workforce advancement authority within the Beast 3.0 Framework.

Mission
Support employment opportunities, workforce growth, career advancement, and skills development through training, education, and employer partnerships.

Core Responsibilities
Job Placement
Workforce Training
Career Development
Skills Certification
Apprenticeships
Employment Navigation
Workforce Analytics
Strategic Objectives
Increase Employment
Develop Skills
Expand Career Opportunities
Strengthen Economic Participation
Improve Workforce Readiness
Status
Development
